
Package: TSCure
Title: Two-Step Estimation for Case-Cohort Studies with a Cure Fraction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xu", "Cao",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "xuc@ucr.edu"),
    person("Qingning", "Zhou",
           role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements semiparametric transformation mixture cure models
    under generalized case-cohort sampling using inverse probability
    weighted sieve likelihood and an EM algorithm. Provides an
    efficiency-improved estimator incorporating auxiliary covariate
    information, multiplier bootstrap inference, AIC-based model
    selection, and simulation utilities. The methodology is developed
    in Zhou and Cao (2025), "Improving Estimation Efficiency for
    Case-cohort Studies with a Cure Fraction",
    <doi:10.1093/biomtc/ujaf059>.
